# Reuse, do not duplicate

Before adding a section, component, style, or helper, look for the one that already does the job and use it.

- The same block on two pages is one component. Home and the product page share `LuckyBanner` for «Мне повезёт». Do not copy that markup or its layout into a page.
- Shared layout (horizontal product strip, photo strip) is one CSS class. Do not restyle the same row in a second rule.
- If a change belongs in the shared piece, edit that piece so every caller gets it.
